# Zonerider

++O!(3D++ @hazard-5@Zonerider@ is a 3D editor a little like Blender. Model with shapes and vertices, add light, animate with keyframes, render images and videos, and export glTF, OBJ and STL!

[Open Zonerider](/zonerider) · [Phone version](/zonerider/mobile/)


::divider{wavy|Zonerider|lime}
## What you can do

* ++L^}Model++: start from shapes and edit their vertices!
* ++Y_:Light and shade++: add lights, and write your own shaders!
* ++B?Animate++: set keyframes and play them back!
* !!_]T#Render# still images and videos!
* ++L//Export++ glTF, OBJ and STL, for other 3D tools or 3D printing!

The ++O<<Help++ menu explains 3D scenes, shaders and animation!

## 3D scenes in documents

Writeout and Bitbook can embed a Zonerider scene, so a document can hold a 3D model people can turn around. In Bitbook it is under **Insert > 3D Scene**. Zonerider runs in a small *embed* mode for this!
